{"data": [{"author_id": "2056166204994392064", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120139415422960054"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 144, "start": 139, "tag": "CBAT"}], "hashtags": [{"end": 108, "start": 92, "tag": "WorldScienceDay"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/hOhcwivPLy", "end": 305, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/CBAKEnergy/status/2120139415422960054/video/1", "media_key": "13_2119960656422330368", "start": 282, "url": "https://t.co/hOhcwivPLy"}]}, "id": "2120139415422960054", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "What does it take to turn a scientific breakthrough into a manufacturable battery?   \n\nOn 🌍 #WorldScienceDay, a look inside CBAK Energy’s ($CBAT) sodium-ion R&amp;D:   \n\n🧪 Milestone: One of the first globally to develop &amp; mass-produce sodium-ion batteries\n\n🔋 From lab to scale: https://t.co/hOhcwivPLy", "url": "https://x.com/CBAKEnergy/status/2120139415422960054"}, {"author_id": "300449911", "created_at": "2026-11-11T19:26:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120592395012362287", "2120599082322514230"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 177, "id": "1006909476774055936", "start": 163, "username": "UM6P_officiel"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ygQIItTmOX", "end": 294, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/MoroccoWNews/status/2120599082322514230/video/1", "media_key": "13_2120582658509946880", "start": 271, "url": "https://t.co/ygQIItTmOX"}]}, "id": "2120599082322514230", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 73, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Philipp Adelhelm, professor at Humboldt University of Berlin, spoke to Morocco World News (MWN) during the International Conference on Sodium Batteries (ICNaB) at @UM6P_officiel in Benguerir, discussing sodium-ion technology’s prospects alongside established lithium-ion https://t.co/ygQIItTmOX", "url": "https://x.com/MoroccoWNews/status/2120599082322514230"}, {"author_id": "1882353145097109504", "created_at": "2026-11-10T09:48:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120091091433353370"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "CATL plans to use battery swapping to overcome sodium-ion range limitations, accelerating adoption while reducing lithium dependence and costs.", "display_url": "chinaevhome.com/2026/11/10/cat…", "end": 223, "expanded_url": "https://chinaevhome.com/2026/11/10/catl-pushes-sodium-ion-batteries-into-passenger-vehicles-via-swap-network/", "images": [{"height": 1250, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120091136903749632/tAU6BVeg?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1920}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120091136903749632/tAU6BVeg?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 200, "status": 200, "title": "CATL Pushes Sodium-Ion Batteries into Passenger Vehicles via Swap Network | ChinaEVHome", "unwound_url": "https://chinaevhome.com/2026/11/10/catl-pushes-sodium-ion-batteries-into-passenger-vehicles-via-swap-network/", "url": "https://t.co/4yuVvWNOnh"}]}, "id": "2120091091433353370", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 484, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "CATL is leveraging its expanding Choco-Swap network to support the adoption of sodium-ion batteries in passenger vehicles.  \n\nThe company expects 10K–20K EVs to use its sodium-ion batteries in 2026.\n\nhttps://t.co/4yuVvWNOnh", "url": "https://x.com/CNEVhome/status/2120091091433353370"}, {"author_id": "1611906439521484801", "created_at": "2026-11-11T03:34:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120359502209765637"], "id": "2120359502209765637", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A 1 GWh sodium-ion project was installed last month. That chemistry skips lithium and cobalt entirely. If sodium-ion costs fall the way lithium did, the supply chain story changes fast. Most people building storage projects aren't pricing that disruption yet.", "url": "https://x.com/grantbmcdaniel/status/2120359502209765637"}, {"author_id": "1244170669970968576", "created_at": "2026-11-10T07:43:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120059837178683818"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "CATL chairman said sodium-ion batteries offer sufficient range for daily urban travel, while more swap stations can ease concerns about longer trips.", "display_url": "cnev.co/l7kwuBF", "end": 257, "expanded_url": "https://cnev.co/l7kwuBF", "images": [{"height": 900, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120059838063595520/H0KtuZFc?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1600}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120059838063595520/H0KtuZFc?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 234, "status": 200, "title": "CATL says expanding swap network will help accelerate sodium-ion battery adoption", "unwound_url": "https://cnevpost.com/2026/11/10/catl-swap-network-help-sodium-ion-adoption/", "url": "https://t.co/m7PCsTeZzq"}]}, "id": "2120059837178683818", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2250, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "CATL says expanding swap network will help accelerate sodium-ion battery adoption\n\nCATL chairman said sodium-ion batteries offer sufficient range for daily urban travel, while more swap stations can ease concerns about longer trips.  https://t.co/m7PCsTeZzq  👇", "url": "https://x.com/CnEVPost/status/2120059837178683818"}, {"author_id": "300449911", "created_at": "2026-11-11T19:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120592395012362287", "2120599082322514230"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 177, "id": "1006909476774055936", "start": 163, "username": "UM6P_officiel"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/yroBjarS4v", "end": 294, "expa