: I'm sharing my U.S. stock grid interconnection notes only with followers who message me today. I look at whether a proposed hookup can handle changes in how a project runs. Join today on WhatsApp 👇 👇 https://t.co/HloDlRTawt https://t.co/UwDMbBNdBi https://t.co/MTEXDTJq95", "url": "https://x.com/JustinWaldor/status/2120516500906013068"}, {"author_id": "1044390963811102721", "created_at": "2026-11-11T17:22:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120567792902549813"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 30, "start": 19, "tag": "REPlus2026"}]}, "id": "2120567792902549813", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AMSC is heading to #REPlus2026 in Las Vegas! ⚡\n\nDiscover our expanded One AMSC portfolio:\n\n- Power &amp; Distribution Transformers from Comtrafo\n- Harmonic Filters &amp; Cap Banks from NEPSI\n- STATCOMs &amp; Grid Interconnection Solutions from AMSC\n\n📩 Schedule a meeting: sales@nepsi.com", "url": "https://x.com/comtrafo/status/2120567792902549813"}, {"author_id": "1806242098083241984", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:11:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120504566370173349"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Sodium-ion battery storage is set to expand across Europe by 2031", "display_url": "energylivenews.com/2026/11/03/sod…", "end": 77, "expanded_url": "https://www.energylivenews.com/2026/11/03/sodium-ion-batteries-are-taking-on-lithium-in-europe/", "images": [{"height": 592, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120504610456494080/dyHYe5X4?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1035}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120504610456494080/dyHYe5X4?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 54, "status": 200, "title": "Sodium-ion batteries are taking on lithium in Europe - Energy Live News", "unwound_url": "https://www.energylivenews.com/2026/11/03/sodium-ion-batteries-are-taking-on-lithium-in-europe/", "url": "https://t.co/b5BReHAdLB"}]}, "id": "2120504566370173349", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Sodium-ion batteries are taking on lithium in Europe\n\nhttps://t.co/b5BReHAdLB", "url": "https://x.com/PES_ltd/status/2120504566370173349"}, {"author_id": "2284025190", "created_at": "2026-11-11T20:33:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120616040686145797"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Following to our previous alert, Technical Advisor Duane Pfund has produced exclusively for subscribers his report on PHMSA's recently published HM-215S International Harmonization Notice of Proposed Rulemaking (NPRM), A Review of Proposed Lithium and Sodium Ion Battery Provisions. His report summarizes the changes proposed affecting lithium and sodium ion batteries, including battery energy storage systems, hybrid batteries, damaged or defective batteries, battery powered vehicles, and passenger air", "display_url": "mailchi.mp/hazmatship/f41…", "end": 119, "expanded_url": "https://mailchi.mp/hazmatship/f41k7p1t4w-16550380", "images": [{"height": 284, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120616043521413120/9wkm9soP?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 500}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120616043521413120/9wkm9soP?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 96, "status": 200, "title": "Exclusive Report: HM-215S NPRM A Review of Proposed Lithium and Sodium Ion Battery Provisions", "unwound_url": "https://mailchi.mp/hazmatship/f41k7p1t4w-16550380", "url": "https://t.co/C0NQa4gKQH"}]}, "id": "2120616040686145797", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Exclusive Report: HM-215S NPRM A Review of Proposed Lithium and Sodium Ion Battery Provisions - https://t.co/C0NQa4gKQH", "url": "https://x.com/hazmatship/status/2120616040686145797"}, {"author_id